# Feature layers

- `domain/`: entities, repository interfaces, use cases, pure rules. No React.
- `data/`: data sources, DTOs, mappers, repository implementations.
- `ui/viewmodels/`: presentation hooks (`useXViewModel`). This is the only UI entry to a repository, via `useDependencies()`.
- `ui/state/`: stores built with `createStore` or `createPersistedStore` from `@/core/state`.
- `ui/styles/`: named NativeWind class maps for the feature.
- `index.ts`: public API only. Cross-feature imports use `@/features/<name>` only.

Do not import another feature's `data`, `ui`, or deep paths.
